  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "工程經濟",
    "sub_ename": "ENGINEERING ECONOMICS",
    "describe_ch": " 工程目的在利用科學知識在環境可承受下，改變環境物理特性以滿足人類需求。然環境資源有限的條件下，工程行為雖有其效益，但亦必須付出成本。如何評估效益、成本與考量經濟可行性，並決定最有利之方案，為本課程主要教學目的。",
    "describe_eh": " Engineers need to know how to analyze the industry and economy, and how to quantitatively evaluate an engineering project and select a best alternative.  The objectives of this course are : 1. Introduce the basic concepts of Economics and Accounting suitable for engineering economic analysis, 2. Fundamental quantitative analytical techniques for evaluating large engineering projects.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "能具備工程應用之數學能力\t",
      "describe_en": "The ability of math for engineering application.\r\n"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "理解工程替代方案之經濟評估方法、熟悉及運用報酬率計算技巧\t",
      "describe_en": "Introduction the methods of economics assessment for engineering alternatives.\r\n"
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "1.\t公共投資計畫之經濟分析評估及決策\t",
      "describe_en": "1.\tFundamental quantitative analytical techniques for evaluating public engineering projects."
    }
  ],
